'''Yanbarun Baliscans''' ({{langx|bl|Yanbarunos baliscanos}}; {{langx|ryu|山原系バリスカ人|Yanbaru-che Baliscan-chu}} ''Yanba'') are [[Baliscans|Baliscan citizens]] who are nationals of [[Yanbaru|Yanbarun]] ancestry or Yanbarun immigrants living in [[Balisca]]. In 2024, [[Instituto Confederal de Stadística]] (ICS) determined that there were roughly 700,000 Yanbarun descendants in Balisca, making it the country with the largest population of Yanbarun origin outside of [[East Fosia]].

